      "id": "claim_b087aba3f1c046f49eec90868ad7d336",
      "statement": "CHD handling runs entirely in process through the in-tree chd-rs crate: chd.rs opens files with Chd::open/open_with_parent on spawn_blocking, writes through chd_rs::create_cd/create_dvd/create_hd/create_ld and extracts through extract_cd/extract_ld/Chd::extract via run_blocking, and get_version returns the literal \"built-in\".",
