    {
      "id": "claim_fdf8aebe37b4417cb8de538e9c1c399d",
      "statement": "Hashing a CHD skips decompression when SHA-1 is the algorithm and the header already supplied data SHA-1 and size; otherwise DVD, hard disk and LaserDisc CHDs are extracted to a temporary directory and the extracted file hashed, and a CD cannot be hashed whole, so check extracts it to CUE/BIN and checks each track against its own ROM.",
