    {
      "id": "claim_99f0ceb2df824b918852cf5382eb05d6",
      "statement": "Because MAME's CHD DATs carry no size and list the CHD's own SHA-1, import_roms retries a failed SHA-1 match of a CHD with its chd_sha1 and size 0.",
