      "id": "claim_22017c033dc84f2da2d0f9d727182c5b",
      "statement": "chd-rs codes FLAC (the flac and cdfl codecs and avhu's audio) with the pure-Rust rusty_flac at MAME's per-hunk block size and level 8, so those hunks are not chdman's bytes but decode in chdman and leave the CHD's data hashes unchanged, as with lzma-rust2 for LZMA.",
