    {
      "id": "claim_63fb893b60df42bda3414df10c0ddf9d",
      "statement": "A CHD FLAC chunk carries only frames: chd-rs decodes them with rusty_flac's FrameDecoder against a synthesized 16-bit, fixed-block-size STREAMINFO, returning the bytes consumed so the cdfl codec can find the deflated subcode after them, and strips the fLaC magic and STREAMINFO the encoder writes in front.",
